; SPIRAL.LGO - a squared spiral that grows a little on every turn
;
; Each time round the loop the turtle walks a bit further than the
; last time and turns a bit less than a right angle. That small
; mismatch is what makes the square twist into a spiral.
; Try: change 91 to 89, 120 or 144. Change the 2 to 1 or 4.

to spiral :size :angle :grow
  if :size > 400 [stop]
  forward :size
  right :angle
  spiral :size + :grow :angle :grow
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setpencolor [40 110 200]
spiral 2 91 2
